Eton~
Eton the Physician stops toying with an odd contraption and smiles at you.
~
An elderly gnome, in his late 300s, wearing overalls and a stethoscope around
his neck.  He prefers this functional attire as he must answer the calls of
the sick and ailing when they arrive whilst pursuing some grand invention 
