hunter bobd-derg~
Bobd-Derg~
Bobd-Derg is quietly pursuing yet another heroic quest.
~
You see a large man, agile as a deer and cunning as a fox.  He has fought
many an incredible beast and completed many a great quest, winning honor and
respect throughout the realms.  He looks frustrated as if your presence 
might hinder him in his pursuit of more adventure.  His look is one of stern
resolution -- offer him your assistance or leave with your life.
~
