wyrm ivo~
Ivo~
You are humbled as Ivo, the great white wyrm, focuses her gaze on you.
~
For a white wyrm, this one is quite large.  Her hide is covered in fine, 
bone-white scales, creating a much smoother appearance than the larger scales
of most dragons.  Her wings look like the bleached sails of a man-of-war as
they stretch for a moment, and then relax against her body.  A squinting pair
of cold blue eyes sizes you up as you hesitate to leave.
~
